{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-03991-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":4,"evidence":["벌금 1500만원을 부과한 것으로 뒤늦게 확인됐다","솜방망이 처벌"],"reason":"The summary keeps the headline fact (a 15 million won fine), the expectation of a much larger fine, the criticism of the penalty as lenient, the investigation timeline, and the experts' view. It omits why the fine was so small: only the false departure-destination report was punished."},"B":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":4,"evidence":["벌금 1500만원","당초에는 불법 환적 규모에 따라 많게는 수십억~수백억원대 벌금형도 예상"],"reason":"The summary is accurate and covers the main fact, the timeline, the lenient-punishment criticism, and the experts' view. It leaves out the reason for the low fine, which was the narrow scope of the punishment."},"C":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":3,"evidence":["선박회사 한 곳에 1500만원","총 12차례에 걸쳐 한국 정부에 출항 목적지를 '싱가포르'라고 신고"],"reason":"The summary merges two facts. The source says the 12 Singapore declarations were false and the fine was imposed on one company, but the summary implies one vessel was punished out of the declaring ships. It also says the fine came from the 'false report' charge without the narrow-scope reason, and it drops the 'lenient punishment' criticism and the expected tens-to-hundreds-of-billions fine. The sentence is awkward."},"D":{"adequacy":4,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":5,"evidence":["출항 목적지를 잘못 쓴 부분에 대해서만 처벌","그러나 관세청은 북한과 교역한 이들 업체 중 한 곳만 '허위 신고죄'로 처벌했다"],"reason":"The summary covers the fine, the larger fine that was expected, the lenient-punishment criticism, the explanation that only the departure-destination discrepancy was punished, and the experts' view. The phrase '이들 업체' has no antecedent, which is a minor flaw."}}}
